
### `.gitignore`

```gitignore
# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# Virtual environments
.venv/
venv/
env/

# Jupyter
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# VS Code
.vscode/

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Python tooling/cache
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.cache/

# Hugging Face / downloaded models
models/
huggingface/
hf_cache/

# Temporary files
*.tmp
*.log